      "cooked": "<p>January 18-21</p><p><b>Westin Boston Waterfront</b><br>425 Summer Street<br>Boston, MA 02210</p><p>Is New Englishman a word??? I think it should be. It sounds way classier than New Englander.</p><p>ANYWAY, yeah, so there's this pretty cool science-fiction convention called Arisia happening soon, and I plan to bring all my Sentinels stuff there to introduce people to the game. This stuff includes the super-secret Shattered Timelines playtesting decks, though playtesting is basically over at this point( SPOILER ALERT: All of it is amazing).</p><p>Who's thinking of going? I know <a href=\"https://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/users/robalan\" title=\"View user profile.\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">robalan</a> mentioned attending; who else is?</p>",
